step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the top-performing model DWT_rf to see if a single best model outperforms the trimmed mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if a broader combination improves over the best single while still selective.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a selective median over the most stable pool1 to see if it improves on best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a median over pool2 to see if a simpler selective median beats best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on pool2 to see if it beats the best single DWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on pool2 to see if weighting improves over best single and median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Try a median combination over pool3 to see if a simpler selective median can beat the best single DWT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if adding the extra DWT_catboost model improves over the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Try a simple median over pool4 to see if it can beat the best single DWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the more diverse pool4 to see if trimming improves over mean/median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the more diverse pool3 to see if a more sophisticated optimizer can beat the best single DWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

